# Everything under .claude/ stays local — settings.local.json, launch.json, and
# .claude/worktrees/, whose checkouts each carry a real .env with the
# service-role key. The one exception is skills/: repo-specific authoring
# knowledge that belongs next to the schema it describes. Keep this scoped —
# a bare `!.claude/` would publish those .env files.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.playwright-mcp/
*.png
!docs/fist-of-ilmater/images/*.png
